safix: state/safix/definitions/alice/api-token.stamps is not a stamp record this version of safix can read.

A stamp record is one line: v1 created=<unix seconds> updated=<unix
seconds>. Restore it from git history to keep the dates it held, or
remove it — an entry with no record reads as having no dates, which is
what every value written before the record existed reads as.
